# The Fifth House · the destroyed past · the revenge

a distilled thread of the ARN (Arena) book-world — the first Magic novel — emergence: spiritual. moniker ⟦The Fifth House:ARN:17fc0c⟧

**who —** The Fifth House — the mage-House destroyed a generation before the novel, the secret behind Garth's arrival.
**what —** The buried wound that drives everything: the House whose ruin made Kuthuman's ascension and made Garth a wanderer with one eye and one purpose.
**where —** Gone a generation, alive only in Garth's revenge.
**why —** Because the gunslinger always rides in for a reason older than the town — the fifth House is the fire Garth has come to answer.
**how —** By its absence — a destroyed House remembered only by the stranger it left, and the planeswalker it raised up.

**the seal —** I was the House they burned to make a god — and the only thing that survived me was a one-eyed boy who never forgot, and came back to collect.

